<title>ECUADOR: Andean Development Corp lends Ecuador $118.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Andean Development Corp lends Ecuador $118.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-08-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Andean Development Corporation said it has awarded Ecuador a loan for $118.2 million to finance infrastructure projects.</p>
<p>Some $70 million of the loan will go to finance a road program in the port of Guayaquil, and $38.2 million will be used for the construction of a stretch of the Panamerican Highway.</p>
<p>The Andean Development Corporation is the financial arm of the Andean Community.</p>
</text>
